{"content":"```\nsimplify: 132 SPIR-V instructions, 8 rewrites proved by SAT (bit-precise: equal for every input), 0 dead instructions removed\n  15 loads of a variable just stored to became the stored value; 0 stores overwritten before any read removed\n  integer arithmetic cost under gt1030 (each instruction once), beyond what spirv-opt -O and a driver's back end do: 34 -> 27 (-20.6%)\n  counting the strength reductions any driver also does: 36.25 -> 27 (-25.5%)\n  also done by any driver compiler (4 rewrites, -2.25; kept in the written module, not counted above): 1 an extract at bit 0 is a mask; 3 a multiply by a power of two is a shift\n  fused by the model in the result (one instruction for several):\n    shl_add          1 x 2     = 2  ((a << k) + b; saves 1)\n    lop3             2 x 1     = 2  (bitwise logic of up to 3 inputs; saves 2)\n  by kind:\n       3  equals its operand                            -4.625\n       1  always this value                             -2.375\n  rewrites:\n    %82 = OpULessThan %bool %80 %uint_64\n      ->  true   (always this value; -2.375)\n    %35 = OpExtInst %int %1 SClamp %33 %int_0 %int_255\n      ->  %33   (equals its operand; -2)\n    %85 = OpSelect %uint %82 %83 %uint_0\n      ->  %63   (equals its operand; -1.625)\n    %42 = OpExtInst %uint %1 UMin %41 %uint_15\n      ->  %41   (equals its operand; -1)\n  dot products: 1 sum of products would be a dot product under gt1030 (cost -7), not written: the module does not declare SPV_KHR_integer_dot_product (OpCapability DotProduct; in GLSL, #extension GL_EXT_integer_dot_product)\n  proved; the operands' definitions were expanded up to 16 levels, the rest (loads, loop phis, spec constants) are free inputs\n  the rewritten module is attached as simplified.spvasm\n```","embeds":[],"allowed_mentions":{"parse":[],"roles":[],"users":[],"replied_user":false},"message_reference":{"message_id":"5001","channel_id":"47","guild_id":"7","fail_if_not_exists":false},"attachments":[{"id":"0","filename":"simplified.spvasm","description":"","content_type":"text/plain","size":3714,"url":"","proxy_url":"","ephemeral":false}]}
